#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"Displays current weather and an optional forecast with a simple consensus "
"across providers (Open-Meteo, SMHI, Yr/MET Norway). Supports shortcode + "
"Gutenberg block + classic widget. Optional Leaflet map, subtle animations, "
"daily forecast, and multiple layouts."
msgstr ""
"Visar aktuellt väder och en valfri prognos med en enkel konsensus mellan "
"leverantörer (Open-Meteo, SMHI, Yr/MET Norge). Stöder shortcode + Gutenberg-"
"block + klassisk widget. Valfri broschyrkarta, diskreta animationer, daglig "
"prognos och flera layouter."

